# Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs may reach the builder. The repo
# root can hold multi-GB strays (fasta files, core dumps, .venv, wandb).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
!docker
# Belt-and-suspenders explicit denials (documents intent):
.git
.venv
.cache
wandb
agent_space__
*.sqsh
core.*
*.fasta
